      "name": "Ammo Clarity",
      "slug": "ammo-clarity",
      "teaser": "Adds caliber to ammo names, while keeping them short enough to read in your inventory.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/4uW2dUfJX6L7017I5RWuTSQxzpzLasAxIzhLKMyk.png",
      "downloads": 5143,
      "favourites_count": 3,
      "description": "<p><strong>Adds caliber to ammo names, while keeping them short enough to read in your inventory.</strong></p>\n<p>Most naming abbreviations are vanilla friendly, so if you’re used to seeing the different ammo types in the game, they should still be easily recognizable to you.</p>\n<p>The one exception to this is 7.62x51. I renamed it to 308 to differentiate it from the other 7.62 ammos. (Yes, I know .308 and 7.62 NATO are technically not the same thing, no I don’t care, change it in the config if you don’t like it.)</p>\n<p>If you’re unhappy with my naming, want to change the language the changes are applied to, etc., visit the config.json file.</p>\n",
